    "detailed_description": "Raise your new friend in a horror themed pet simulation!<br><br>As a new owner, it is your responsibility to get to know your buddy! Each has it's own set of likes, and dislikes which can<br>effect how they interact with not only you, but any of your neighbors. If developed right, you will not have a problem, but...<br>if not appeased, chances are you'll end up in jail, covering up murder, or even as dinner yourself!<br><br>These horrors must stay, Happy, Healthy, Fed, and Beautiful!<br><br>Friends and neighbors will often visit, or you will see them on walks. They also have their own personalities, so figure which stat<br>correlates with the neighbor to keep your monster from lashing out! Wouldn't want the police coming around asking questions.<br><br>Good luck to you and your new buddy!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Raise 4 horrors!<br></li><li>Each horror grows and changes at 2 weeks in!<br></li><li>Unlock 9 unique endings! Some with variations.</li></ul>",
